  "sourceText": "Johnnie Cake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 11:39pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Plain flour\n1 teaspoon Salt\n3 teaspoons Baking powder\n3 teaspoons Oil\n1 cup Milk\n2 tablespoons Sugar-optional\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix dry ingredients; add liquids. Mix together and knead for a few minutes. 2 Put into a greased 8x8 in. pan and place in a preheated oven at 375F. Bake approximately 20 min.",
